      "uid": "zhcn:cb915e67a859a9ede0506197",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊！？那哪能算是交流啊？\n别让我回想起无聊的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac371fe2bd5e81b2bd4d476d8b45e2c61c8f2c8208062e0ae553783f7f28680d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
